.TH Empire "Command Summary"
.s3
This list contains one-line descriptions of each Empire command;
further information on a particular command may be obtained by running
info on that command (e.g. "info attack").
.s1
.nf
EMPIRE COMMANDS
.ta 1.2i
Annex\*(HTClaim sectors from a defeated enemy
Announce\*(HTSend an announcement to all players
Assault\*(HTAttack coastal sector from ship
Attack\*(HTAttempt to seize a sector from another country
Board\*(HTBoard enemy ship
Build\*(HTBuild ships or bridges in specified sectors
Bye\*(HTLog out of Empire
Census\*(HTReport contents of sectors
Change\*(HTChange country name, representative's name or user
Checkpoint\*(HTDesignate checkpoint code for sector(s)
Coastwatch\*(HTCheck from sectors for nearby ships
Collect\*(HTForeclose an overdue loan
Commodity\*(HTReport commodities in sectors
Consider\*(HTAccept, decline or postpone consideration of a loan or treaty
Contract\*(HTArrange to sell production (automatically) to country #0
Country\*(HTList last access, BTUs, status and name for each country
Declare\*(HTFormally declare alliance, neutrality or war
Deliver\*(HTEstablish delivery routes for shells, ore, etc
Designate\*(HTSpecify sector utilization
Detonate\*(HTDetonate nuclear device
Dissolve\*(HTDissolve your government and country (suicide)
Enlist\*(HTTurn civilians into military
Execute\*(HTTake commands from the specified file
Fail-safe\*(HTSet fail-safe code & coordinates on nuclear device
Fire\*(HTFire artillery from sector/ship on sector/ship
Fleetadd\*(HTDesignate members of a "fleet"
Fly\*(HTFly planes from sector/ship to sector/ship and bomb or snoop
Forecast\*(HTPredict future weather conditions
Grant\*(HTGive away sectors to another (adjacent) country
Headlines\*(HTSummarize the weeks events (part of "news")
Info\*(HTProvide information on various topics
Ledger\*(HTReport on outstanding loans
List\*(HTBrief command list
Load\*(HTLoad goods, people, etc onto a ship
Lookout\*(HTCheck from ships for other ships and/or sector types
Map\*(HTGenerate a map showing sector types, seas, etc
Mine\*(HTDrop mines from destroyer
Move\*(HTTransport ore, civilians, guns, etc
Nation\*(HTThe state of your nation
Navigate\*(HTMove ship or fleet around
News\*(HTThe yellow press
Offer\*(HTOffer a loan or treaty to another country
Power\*(HTDisplay arbitrarily measured strengths of all countries
Quit\*(HTLog out of Empire
Radar\*(HTPerform radar scan from ship or sector
Read\*(HTRead your telegrams
Realm\*(HTPrint out or modify one of your four "realms"
Repay\*(HTRepay a loan (all or part)
Route\*(HTDisplay delivery routes
Set\*(HTEstablish price for a ship
Shell\*(HTSpawn a shell
Ship\*(HTReport status of ship, fleet or ships in a given area
Spy\*(HTSnoop on adjacent enemy sectors
Telegram\*(HTSend "diplomatic" communique to another country
Tend\*(HTSupply ships with guns and/or shells
Test\*(HTCheck the effect of a proposed move
Torpedo\*(HTSlip a torpedo to some poor sucker (from a sub)
Trade\*(HTGenerate a report on ships for sale and perhaps buy some
Transport\*(HTMove a nuclear device around
Treaty\*(HTListing of all current and pending treaties
Unload\*(HTInverse of load (above)
Update\*(HTPerform updates in all sectors and set "realm"
Version\*(HTDisplay parameters of this game
Weather\*(HTProduce a weather map
.fi
